  unitName: God Tree Eltri
  unitId: 30114
  unitNumber: 143
  description: Eltri is said to be the ancestor of all the trees in Grand Gaia. Immense
    and able to float in the air, it's so impressive that some people mistake it
    for a floating island. If it floats in the same place for many years, sometimes
    a forest will suddenly appear nearby, even in wastelands. It is worshipped as
    the God Tree as it has the ability to sprout life all around it.
  summonDesc: I have shone light on the paths the world and yourself travel.<br>Now
    I will follow you.
  fusionDesc: The power within me will <br>circle the world and return to <br>you
    again.
  evoDesc: Even if each individual is small, the accumulation of their power is great.
  element: 3
  rarity: 4
